      "id": "claim_39f63040b1664aa58a9c5dbedf183006",
      "statement": "Tasks reach ExecutionEngine through two lanes: the planning lane POST /api/work-items (WorkItemService, work_items rows with lifecycle candidate/triaged/planned/leased/blocked/done/discarded, whose convert-to-goal transactionally creates a goal and marks the item planned) and the direct lane POST /api/tasks plus POST /api/tasks/:id/execute (requirePermission execute:task), which resolves the executor kind with precedence request body executor → persisted metadata.executor → 'opencode'.",
