      "statement": "A deny decision cancels the task with a critical policy-decision evidence row, an error execution event, an EXECUTION_DENIED audit row, and an EXECUTION_DENIED_BY_POLICY broadcast; a require_approval without a valid approval bound to the exact execution input (metadata.executorKind plus executionInputHash) creates an approval, moves the task to awaiting_approval, emits APPROVAL_REQUESTED and an EXECUTION_PAUSED audit row, and resumes later through handleApprovalDecision(), which audits EXECUTION_RESUMED and re-enters executeTask with the approval's bound executor kind.",
