      "statement": "Because the global runtime permit (runtimeConcurrencySemaphore, RUNTIME_MAX_CONCURRENCY default 4) waits asynchronously after the HTTP response, the engine revalidates after the wait: holds, durable status still queued, an unchanged executionInputHash, and a fresh risk/policy/governance-gate evaluation — a tightened deny or stale approval fails the dispatch with a 409, and deep-agent tasks receive their signed Federation contract only at this point, replacing any task-supplied contract before the capability re-check.",
